{"data": [{"author_id": "1444516072292593664", "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:43:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120467410943635502"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KYx5K8yqnm", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NextScience/status/2120467410943635502/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120467405956644864", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/KYx5K8yqnm"}]}, "id": "2120467410943635502", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 54, "impression_count": 5247, "like_count": 280, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 93}, "text": "🚨 Scientists Are Now Testing DNA Repair Technology Directly Inside the Human Body! \n\nWhat if doctors could correct a disease-causing genetic mistake without removing a patient's cells or performing a transplant?\nThat possibility is moving closer to reality.\n\nIn 2025, researchers https://t.co/KYx5K8yqnm", "url": "https://x.com/NextScience/status/2120467410943635502"}, {"author_id": "2099398583351115776", "created_at": "2026-11-12T04:32:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120736535159185626"], "id": "2120736535159185626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "基因編輯 vs 靈魂覺醒：我們是在療癒肉身，還是在僭越神聖？🧬✨ \n\n如果改變一段 DNA 代碼就能讓你永葆青春、甚至提升智商，你會選擇重寫生命嗎？🤔  隨著體細胞單鹼基編輯（Base Editing）與引導編輯（Prime", "url": "https://x.com/mayaphil7687/status/2120736535159185626"}, {"author_id": "2801692272", "created_at": "2026-11-11T16:09:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120549599610015894"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "PRME"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lordhodler/sta…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lordhodler/status/2120147432600199256", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/SQNAax3Cru"}]}, "id": "2120549599610015894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 836, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "$PRME Some context worth adding.\n\nSlide 9 of Monday's deck: \"Any combination or permutation of a CRISPR-Cas enzyme, template Guide RNA with a Reverse Transcriptase is Prime Editing and is covered by our extensive patent estate.\"\n\n10 U.S. and 21 ex-U.S. issued patents.\nSlide 36: https://t.co/SQNAax3Cru", "url": "https://x.com/LordHodler/status/2120549599610015894"}, {"author_id": "1410008852171411461", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:39:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120587329156882449"], "id": "2120587329156882449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Doctors corrected a single wrong letter of DNA inside patients' livers, and their bodies started making a missing protective protein again.\n\nAlpha-1 antitrypsin deficiency is an inherited disorder: one misplaced DNA \"letter\" means the liver makes a faulty version of a protein", "url": "https://x.com/CouncilShiba/status/2120587329156882449"}, {"author_id": "68942483", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:45:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120588646554251479"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 107, "id": "64375648", "start": 95, "username": "PET_BioNews"}], "urls": [{"description": "Le « prime editing » a permis de corriger une mutation dans les cellules souches sanguines d'un patient", "display_url": "genethique.org/complement/pri…", "end": 131, "expanded_url": "https://genethique.org/complement/prime-editing-une-mutation-corrigee-dans-les-cellules-souches-sanguines-dun-patient/", "images": [{"height": 512, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120588671124414465/79x4JPkl?format=png&name=orig", "width": 512}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120588671124414465/79x4JPkl?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 108, "status": 200, "title": "« Prime editing » : une mutation corrigée dans les cellules souches sanguines d'un patient - Gènéthique", "unwound_url": "https://genethique.org/complement/prime-editing-une-mutation-corrigee-dans-les-cellules-souches-sanguines-dun-patient/", "url": "https://t.co/QAwjwyRWHA"}]}, "id": "2120588646554251479", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "« Prime editing » : une mutation corrigée dans les cellules souches sanguines d'un patient via @PET_BioNews https://t.co/QAwjwyRWHA", "url": "https://x.com/Genethique/status/2120588646554251479"}, {"author_id": "1961395586", "created_at": "2026-11-12T09:31:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120811694653854056"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "sciencedirect.com/science/articl…", "end": 114, "expanded_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2662173826000688", "start": 91, "unwound_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2662173826000688", "url": "https://t.co/x3TCxNhnFf"}]}, "id": "2120811694653854056", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 214, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI-designed OpenCRISPR-1 enables efficient targeted mutagenesis and prime editing in rice.\nhttps://t.co/x3TCxNhnFf", "url": "https://x.com/PanosSarris/status/2120811694653854056"}, {"author_id": "2361611131", "created_at": "2026-11-11T01:03:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120321609206812784"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 113, "start": 107, "tag": "MTMCD"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VttlHb1y0a", "end": 137, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MolTherapy/status/2120321609206812784/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120321607650672640", "start": 114, "url": "https://t.co/VttlHb1y0a"}]}, "id": "2120321609206812784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 262, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "An integrated enzymatic and computational pipeline for quantifying off-target base-editing dlvr.​it/TWHBsW #MTMCD https://t.co/VttlHb1y0a", "url": "https://x.com/MolTherapy/status/2120321609206812784"}, {"author_id": "1060595604022280192", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:51:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120499593284657461"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 32, "start": 27, "tag": "BEAM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Quantumup1/sta…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Quantumup1/status/2118315776750862347", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/cr07Tt7S8t"}]}, "id": "2120499593284657461", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 859, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "H.C. Wainwright reiterated $BEAM Buy-$80 after Beam announced that the BEACON Phase 1/2 trial evaluating ristoglogene autogetemcel (risto-cel) in sickle cell disease (SCD) met its primary efficacy endpoint.\n[AGIO VRTX CRSP PFE IRON SNY]\nH.C. Wainwright said in its note:\nThe https://t.co/cr07Tt7S8t", "url": "https://x.com/Quantumup1/status/2120499593284657461"}, {"author_id": "2110437865809174528", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:48:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120574334905573738"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 193, "start": 180, "tag": "PrimeEditing"}, {"end": 197, "start": 194, "tag": "AI"}], "urls": [{"description": "Can rewriting DNA change the future for families living with rare g...", "display_url": "youtu.be/bsjvU2BFTxo", "end": 251, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/bsjvU2BFTxo", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119485302360133632/hzzBfMxa?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119485302360133632/hzzBfMxa?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 228, "status": 200, "title": "David Liu: Gene Editing to Treat Rare Disease", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bsjvU2BFTxo&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/r1ZeMwYDyo"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/TuNcNcYs7f", "end": 275, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GENErationHopee/status/2120574334905573738/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120574206211506177", "start": 252, "url": "https://t.co/TuNcNcYs7f"}]}, "id": "2120574334905573738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "An AI built around how prime editing works. Dr. David R. Liu on a machine-learning model that predicts editing outcomes, so researchers test a dozen designs instead of thousands.\n\n#PrimeEditing #AI\n\nWatch the full conversation: https://t.co/r1ZeMwYDyo https://t.co/TuNcNcYs7f", "url": "https://x.com/GENErationHopee/status/2120574334905573738"}, {"author_id": "346441888", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:18:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120476360657588591"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "BEAM"}], "mentions": [{"end": 226, "id": "21079030", "start": 214, "username": "PharmaScrip"}]}, "id": "2120476360657588591", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$BEAM Therapeutics is targeting a year-end US regulatory filing for risto-cel after the investigational base-editing therapy met the primary efficacy and safety endpoints in its pivotal BEACON trial. My latest for @PharmaScrip", "url": "https://x.com/SushmitaPanda/status/2120476360657588591"}, {"author_id": "71542880", "created_at": "2026-11-12T11:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120833986985599235"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 257, "start": 245, "tag": "GeneEditing"}, {"end": 269, "start": 258, "tag": "SickleCell"}], "mentions": [{"end": 52, "id": "940684399456280578", "start": 45, "username": "BeamTx"}], "urls": [{"description": "US biotech company Beam Therapeutics is preparing to seek US approval for ristoglogene autogetemcel, or risto-cel, after its one-time sickle cell disease treatment met the primary endpoint in a Phase I/II study. The company said it plans to submit a Biologics License Application (BLA) to the US regulator as early as the end of 2026. Beam said the filing could become the first BLA submitted for a therapy based on base editing.", "display_url": "thepharmaletter.com/biotech-news/b…", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://www.thepharmaletter.com/biotech-news/beam-lines-up-year-end-fda-filing-after-sickle-cell-trial-hit", "images": [{"height": 515, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120833992144642048/Ai59yzrx?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 700}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120833992144642048/Ai59yzrx?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "Beam lines up year-end FDA filing after sickle cell trial hit", "unwound_url": "https://www.thepharmaletter.com/biotech-news/beam-lines-up-year-end-fda-filing-after-sickle-cell-trial-hit", "url": "https://t.co/nJ55yfOghz"}]}, "id": "2120833986985599235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 186, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Base editing heads for its first FDA filing: @BeamTx plans to submit risto-cel for sickle cell disease as early as year-end after BEACON met its primary endpoint: 12 months or more free of severe vaso-occlusive crises.\n\nhttps://t.co/nJ55yfOghz\n\n#GeneEditing #SickleCell", "url": "https://x.com/ThePharmaLetter/status/2120833986985599235"}, {"author_id": "1187686290269097985", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:03:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120427132262244395"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 259, "start": 247, "tag": "GeneEditing"}, {"end": 271, "start": 260, "tag": "Hepatology"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "doi.org/10.1016/j.jhep…", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhep.2026.09.028", "start": 222, "unwound_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0168827826029351", "url": "https://t.co/oaioz0LD5V"}]}, "id": "2120427132262244395", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Our clinic at Hannover Medical School has reason to celebrate! 🧬 In one patient with AAT deficiency, liver biopsy confirmed 54–57% SERPINA1 allele correction after in vivo base editing. An important proof of feasibility.\n\nhttps://t.co/oaioz0LD5V\n\n#GeneEditing #Hepatology", "url": "https://x.com/HardtkeWolenski/status/2120427132262244395"}, {"author_id": "36066745", "created_at": "2026-11-12T15:58:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120909102402732471"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature Reviews Drug Discovery - Base editing, a gene editing technology capable of installing point mutations with high efficiency and precision, was first reported a decade ago. This Review...", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/s4157…", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41573-026-01548-7", "images": [{"height": 1575, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120909152965009408/Tu5iHqoJ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2168}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120909152965009408/Tu5iHqoJ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 222, "status": 200, "title": "Translating base editors: a decade of progress from the bench to the clinic", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41573-026-01548-7?error=cookies_not_supported&code=679da26e-659b-44d6-9ded-293cc07cf177", "url": "https://t.co/E3Ss08brRw"}, {"display_url": "rdcu.be/3UX2Kyig8EQa", "end": 269, "expanded_url": "https://rdcu.be/3UX2Kyig8EQa", "start": 246, "status": 202, "unwound_url": "https://rdcu.be/3UX2Kyig8EQa", "url": "https://t.co/3LONx7z0Sv"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/d7h8Axcp9P", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NatRevDrugDisc/status/2120909102402732471/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120909019120386048", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/d7h8Axcp9P"}]}, "id": "2120909102402732471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1169, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "For readers interested in base-editing therapeutics, such as Beam's therapy risto-cel for sickle cell disease that recently succeeded in a phase I/II trial, here's a review on a decade of progress by pioneers in the field\nhttps://t.co/E3Ss08brRw\nhttps://t.co/3LONx7z0Sv https://t.co/d7h8Axcp9P", "url": "https://x.com/NatRevDrugDisc/status/2120909102402732471"}, {"author_id": "1517054690898309120", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:24:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120432474002276435"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 277, "start": 273, "tag": "LLY"}]}, "id": "2120432474002276435", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Lilly has refiled an IND in China for VERVE-102, the PCSK9 base-editing therapy it picked up through its Verve acquisition. An earlier August filing did not receive implied approval. Another sign Lilly is pushing in vivo gene editing for cardiovascular disease into China. $LLY", "url": "https://x.com/CNBioXYZ/status/2120432474002276435"}, {"author_id": "4058194633", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:22:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120522596538306608"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "BEAM"}, {"end": 12, "start": 7, "tag": "CRSP"}, {"end": 19, "start": 14, "tag": "VRTX"}], "urls": [{"description": "The result represents a scientific milestone and positions Beam to submit a first-of-its-kind FDA application as soon as the end of the year.", "display_url": "biopharmadive.com/news/beam-sick…", "end": 262, "expanded_url": "https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/beam-sickle-cell-base-editing-risto-cel-results/874242/", "images": [{"height": 380, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120204382314856448/rJZ7DKli?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 770}, {"height": 150, 