31, "username": "BeamTx"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/NLipWdsrRt", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jayvberube/status/2120492524116820224/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120492457242550272", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/NLipWdsrRt"}]}, "id": "2120492524116820224", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I had the opportunity to visit @BeamTx’s lab in Cambridge a few years ago and worked with many of their scientists. Always enjoyed supporting their team.\n\nGreat to see their recent success with risto-cel and the positive BEACON trial results. A major milestone for base editing! https://t.co/NLipWdsrRt", "url": "https://x.com/jayvberube/status/2120492524116820224"}, {"author_id": "191281008", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:11:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120263163170230587"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "BEAM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/zhaoweiasu/sta…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/zhaoweiasu/status/2117651009753518127", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/w1AITYvFSJ"}]}, "id": "2120263163170230587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 2975, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "$BEAM's president Pino said: \"We feel we have before the end of the decade an opportunity for at least 4 programs to lanuch. And we are working very actively on many other programs, including delivering to tissues beyond the liver.\"\n\nIf that turns out to be true, my earlier https://t.co/w1AITYvFSJ", "url": "https://x.com/zhaoweiasu/status/2120263163170230587"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120652801101692991"], "id": "2120652801101692991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 99, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retwee